I am a Vtuber. I am a Vtuber and I would like to request a life-size illustration of Amu Menmai.\nI would like a life-size illustration of Amu Noodle Mai.\nI would like to use it for the following purposes.\n(1) Posting on SNS\n(2) Use on distribution sites such as Youtube and twitch (including monetization) (thumbnails, in videos and distribution, etc.)\n(3) Use as icons and headers on SNS and distribution sites\n(4) Use in distribution as online prints\n(5) Use within a leitmotif link\nIllustrations may be trimmed to fit each content (e.g., when using icons, trimmed to a square to fit the frame of the icon).\nAbout the person\n(1) The position of the Naruto on the head should be \"on the right side as seen by the person facing you\".\n (2) The direction of Naruto's roll should be \"right side up\" with the head drawn from the outside. The Naruto pattern on the sleeves should be curled outward on both the left and right sides.\n(3) Only the part of the twin-tail has a salmon pink color mesh.\n (4) Please draw the hair and costume as they are in the documents.\n  (1) We would be happy if the upper body, hair, chemo-ears, and tail are not cut off.\n (2) We will leave the composition and pose to you.\n\nDelivery\nWe would like to receive the image in PSD or PNG format.\nWe would also like to receive a transparent background for the person only.\n We would appreciate your consideration.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1O4aTP6b1sOAVV9TqlHOpbTAQvgAoS_wN/view?usp=drivesdk", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@tamamorh/works/14", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/74714123/uploads/origins/22aa68bd-e3ba-4ecb-b792-48fc05cc1e96?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=28fd0b000d3a51f7a080e4b0fe974fa0", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/74714123/uploads/origin