 myself...!\n\nI would like to ask you to dress me in the following bunny outfit (with or without the tail).\n　（I would like you to use the following bunny outfit (with or without tails, I leave that up to you).\nI would like to use the illustration for my VTuber activities.\n　(Icons, headers, thumbnails, videos, Twitter posts, etc.)\nWe would appreciate it if you could use a separate layer for the address and background.\nWe would appreciate it if you could make sure that the left, right, and top layers are not cut off.\n\n<Additional information\nThe breasts are modest.\nThe hair on the back reaches to the middle of the back.\n\nWe apologize for the inconvenience, but we would appreciate your cooperation.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1WYsl3RD-Un3ApsEa9Cg45QBBbDWKTJaX/view?usp=drive_link", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@tamamorh/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1730767, "client_id": 1341521, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ffff005c/uploads/origins/f59dee2a-7b7f-4cc6-81ac-8329fbac377d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bd0f8d613534fc88581c9cfd96684ea1", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ffff005c/uploads/origins/f59dee2a-7b7f-4cc6-81ac-8329fbac377d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bd0f8d613534fc88581c9cfd96684ea1, https://si.imgix.net/ffff005c/uploads/origins/f59dee2a-7b7f-4cc6-81ac-8329fbac377d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b574cf29c1f59e8b740c1792d64589ac 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ffff005c/uploads/origins/f59dee2a-7b7f-4cc6-81ac-8329fbac377d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ea7a84d67b533ed1e3678d9fe1b1d969 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ffff005c/uploads/origins/f59dee2a-7b7f-4cc6-81ac-8329fbac377d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=42dfb620a702bb0c5e080cdca86a50b2", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ffff005c/uploads/origins/f59dee2a-7b7f-4cc6-81ac-8329fbac377d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=42dfb620a702bb0c5e080cdca86a50b2, https://si.imgix.net/ffff005c/uploads/origins/f59dee2a-7b7f-4cc6-81ac-8329fbac377d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3e78dd3a578dd7133da226bd07725077 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ffff005c/uploads/origins/f59dee2a-7b7f-4cc6-81ac-8329fbac377d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=436f43db4cb72255faf17e10c4f4d4d8 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you, my name is Yuku Yui, a ba-bi-meat-failure astral projectionist Vtuber.\nI saw your illustration on X and fell in love with it at first sight because I really liked the way you drew the character's facial expressions and the gentle texture.\nI would like to ask tamamo to draw an illustration of Yui in winter costume.\n\nThe body is a floating astral body.\nThe girl can move freely.\nThe girl has no facial expression (eyes and mouth are movable).\nSorry, we do not have a three-sided view, only a front view.\nThe scarf and the ears on the head can be removed, but we would appreciate it if you could attach them this time.\n\nWe would like to ask for the following\nI would like to leave the composition to Mr. Tamamo.\nI would like to have a \"Quick Ball\" of Pokemon.\n　(If possible, I would be happy if there is a difference in which only the ball is hidden.)\nPlease do not include horror elements.\n\nWe would appreciate it if you would allow us to post the video on Twitter and post it on YouTube during the streaming (we will use it as a thumbnail and during the streaming, so please assume that it will remain in the archive).\nWe would also like to use it as a thumbnail, etc. If you could also draw the background, we would appreciate it if you could provide us with the transparent difference separately.\n(You can also send us a .psd or similar file.)\n\nThank you in advance for your cooperation.\n\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/873486302950068224/1034068286498947172/d988e1f3a1c2304e.png", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@tamamorh/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1730767, "client_id": 717879, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/73eb21fe/uploads/origins/7219b87e-9f40-4c25-aaba-5aa368bdf116?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f106d311c438e5e27b9cc7130c2dad83", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/73eb21fe/uploads/origins/7219b87e-9f40-4c25-aaba-5aa368bdf116?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f106d311c438e5e27b9cc7130c2dad83, https://si.imgix.net/73eb21fe/uploads/origins/7219b87e-9f40-4c25-aaba-5aa368bdf116?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=941b5c7390a58c5bdeb39eee10dbfe7c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/73eb21fe/uploads/origins/7219b87e-9f40-4c25-aaba-5aa368bdf116?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2f8f9a2c4cdc257f9dafddbbdab22517 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/73eb21fe/uploads/origins/7219b87e-9f40-4c25-aaba-5aa368bdf116?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0a8e7aa5f4fb164c18d3cabbb33f742c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/73eb21fe/uploads/origins/7219b87e-9f40-4c25-aaba-5aa368bdf116?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0a8e7aa5f4fb164c18d3cabbb33f742c, https://si.imgix.net/73eb21fe/uploads/origins/7219b87e-9f40-4c25-aaba-5aa368bdf116?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1882033aafe1189a0f62596a1102d301 2x, https://si.imgix.net/73eb21fe/uploads/origins/7219b87e-9f40-4c25-aaba-5aa368bdf116?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3488a3205da744382d63bacb6c9c2b97 3x"}, "body": "Hello Tamamo, my name is Yutti.\nI am sending this message to ask you to draw Luna Koishiro (@kohakuruna), who is preparing for Vsinger.\n\nThe composition should look like she is singing with a microphone.\nOther than that, I leave it to you.\n\nWe consider it a gift, so please separate the layers.\nPlease check the reference material for the standing picture on her twitter site lit.link.\n\nWe would appreciate it if you could give us permission to use it on SNS, thumbnails, etc. (no commercial use).\nWe understand that you are busy, but we would appreciate your consideration.", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@tamamorh/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1730767, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7c088f3e/uploads/origins/d2f69880-eb1d-4357-938c-fee5c16f97b0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=194cfa783bae02283dfe7e551328fc37", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7c088f3e/uploads/origins/d2f69880-eb1d-4357-938c-fee5c16f97b0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=194cfa783bae02283dfe7e551328fc37, https://si.imgix.net/7c088f3e/uploads/origins/d2f69880-eb1d-4357-938c-fee5c16f97b0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2a72e6c23c64098637bc1722f6d291b8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7c088f3e/uploads/origins/d2f69880-eb1d-4357-938c-fee5c16f97b0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8b3c9712552fe652ec9de25f5c1eafb8 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7c088f3e/uploads/origins/d2f69880-eb1d-4357-938c-fee5c16f97b0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c4fde2b0148784b700e696af9ca0ebbe", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7c088f3e/uploads/origins/d2f69880-eb1d-4357-938c-fee5c16f97b0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c4fde2b0148784b700e696af9ca0ebbe, https://si.imgix.net/7c088f3e/uploads/origins/d2f69880-eb1d-4357-938c-fee5c16f97b0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6e1582329dd0c8f82f72f015e527ba9b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7c088f3e/uploads/origins/d2f69880-eb1d-4357-938c-fee5c16f97b0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=dfdcfcc99673cac3c3d16c6ba898933e 3x"}, "body": "It is nice to meet you.\nI would like to submit this request because of a wonderful illustration I happened to see by chance.\nI would appreciate it if you would consider my request for a standing picture of our child, who is active in table talk RPGs and games that use original characters.\n\nShe is a child like the one in the link below.\n\nhttps://moo-tyaunen.ssl-lolipop.jp/txiloda/picture.php?user=yutayuta&file=335930-1a.png\n\nhttps://moo-tyaunen.ssl-lolipop.jp/txiloda/picture.php?user=yutayuta&file=aa.png\n\nIntended use.\nI plan to use it for table talk RPGs, games that use original character illustrations, etc.\n\nRules\nWhen using illustrations, please be sure to post your name.\nI will not use the illustrations for the purpose of making money.\nWe will not modify the illustrations with AI.\n\nRequests\nPlease show us the original character in school swimsuit as linked above.\nPlease make sure that the whole body of the character is shown as much as possible.\nWe will leave the background and pose up to you, but it would be helpful if you could layer the image of the character alone in PSD format.\n\nWe are sorry for your busy schedule, but we would appreciate it very much.", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@tamamorh/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1730767, "client_id": 2653659, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/79e34fb1/uploads/origins/bfbe182d-5e3d-4122-9cfc-0e3c3a5138ac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=324f48491b0143b4f124adb570b81ae2", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/79e34fb1/uploads/origins/bfbe182d-5e3d-4122-9cfc-0e3c3a5138ac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=324f48491b0143b4f124adb570b81ae2, https://si.imgix.net/79e34fb1/uploads/origins/bfbe182d-5e3d-4122-9cfc-0e3c3a5138ac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=47887fd7fceebae2db42f26a7f4f7e76 2x, https://si.imgix.net/79e34fb1/uploads/origins/bfbe182d-5e3d-4122-9cfc-0e3c3a5138ac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aa0f59acb9be3908e72cbeccaafc0832 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/79e34fb1/uploads/origins/bfbe182d-5e3d-4122-9cfc-0e3c3a5138ac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=acd8498a707a7b758cffbb6a399d6e29", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/79e34fb1/uploads/origins/bfbe182d-5e3d-4122-9cfc-0e3c3a5138ac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=acd8498a707a7b758cffbb6a399d6e29, https://si.imgix.net/79e34fb1/uploads/origins/bfbe182d-5e3d-4122-9cfc-0e3c3a5138ac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ed48eaaa1d3a6b3e6beb9769a25af470 2x, https://si.imgix.net/79e34fb1/uploads/origins/bfbe182d-5e3d-4122-9cfc-0e3c3a5138ac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f5e51bb8dba205a3e4c8cef890a1f2e7 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you! My name is Furyashiashi, and I am an individual Vtuber.\nI love the atmosphere of your illustrations!\nI would like to send you a request to draw myself, if you don't mind.\n\nI would love to have you draw me.\nI would like to have an illustration of VTuber Furyushia, a fox god who has fallen from the heavens.\nWe will leave all the poses and situations up to you.\nWe would appreciate it if you could draw her so that the top of her head and the area around her face are not completely covered.\nIf possible, we would be very happy if you could give us a simple facial expression...!\n\nUsage】・・・Use on Twitter and other social networking sites.\nUse on social networking services such as Twitter.\nUse on our monetized YouTube channel.\nUse in FANBOX, distribution of online prints to FANBOX supporters\nWe would appreciate it if you could inform us in the PSD data if there is any use that is *not* allowed.\n\nDelivery format\nWe apologize for the inconvenience.\nWe would greatly appreciate it if you could provide us with PSD data with the person, background, address, etc. layered!\n\nReference data\nThree views: https://twitter.com/FeliciaFleur/status/1644980198436384770\nProfile: https://lit.link/FeliciaFleur\n\nWe look forward to your consideration!", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@tamamorh/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1730767, "client_id": 2645954, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4d4678e4/uploads/origins/b8307c64-d12d-4c22-a0b8-31c218ce5e52?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=63d25ede244bc02ac38f8f8184846d14", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4d4678e4/uploads/origins/b8307c64-d12d-4c22-a0b8-31c218ce5e52?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=63d25ede244bc02ac38f8f8184846d14, https://si.imgix.net/4d4678e4/uploads/origins/b8307c64-d12d-4c22-a0b8-31c218ce5e52?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=875b1aad75db5717c575b74581281532 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4d4678e4/uploads/origins/b8307c64-d12d-4c22-a0b8-31c218ce5e52?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8a67921645bf2cc03956eac9381f86f6 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4d4678e4/uploads/origins/b8307c64-d12d-4c22-a0b8-31c218ce5e52?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8fb552ca21cac4ae04d27919a5a6f7d1", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4d4678e4/uploads/origins/b8307c64-d12d-4c22-a0b8-31c218ce5e52?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8fb552ca21cac4ae04d27919a5a6f7d1, https://si.imgix.net/4d4678e4/uploads/origins/b8307c64-d12d-4c22-a0b8-31c218ce5e52?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a8e2ad0fd8634ccf2e5e96012729b7d7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4d4678e4/uploads/origins/b8307c64-d12d-4c22-a0b8-31c218ce5e52?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1f83f084fec66904c0ff508637f09c43 3x"}, "body": "はじめまして！\nVtuber準備中の真白猫ミミィと申します...！\n\nタマモ様のイラストの色合いや絵柄が本当にすごく好みで私もタマモ様に真白猫ミミィを描いていただきたいなと思いメッセージを送らせていただきました(T_T)！\n\n構図や表情など全てタマモ様のおまかせでお願いいたします...！\n\nYouTubeのサムネイルやTwitterのヘッダー等に使用させていただきたいので、出来ればPSDデータで人物と背景分けて描いていただけると幸いです(T . T)\n\n🤍キャラ詳細\nお金持ちの家族に飼われている白猫\n家では猫かぶって大人しくしているが\n家族が寝静まると暴れ回るので絆創膏や包帯が巻かれている\nメンヘラ気質\nかわいいものがすき\n\nもしご縁がございましたらよろしくお願いいたします...！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1bA9wD91m3PS-laxyHhEm_Q53BLvxlvcW", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@tamamorh/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1730767, "client_id": 2505868, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/49461942/uploads/origins/bbd2e3c8-0e0c-4c07-a3f9-a4c10a7c5120?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=26eb71e8a94bcba2af29238056cb2985", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/49461942/uploads/origins/bbd2e3c8-0e0c-4c07-a3f9-a4c10a7c5120?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=26eb71e8a94bcba2af29238056cb2985, https://si.imgix.net/49461942/uploads/origins/bbd2e3c8-0e0c-4c07-a3f9-a4c10a7c5120?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8542c06b0cc564a036b1a2b77ef981fd 2x, https://si.imgix.net/49461942/uploads/origins/bbd2e3c8-0e0c-4c07-a3f9-a4c10a7c5120?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=59f2510931dba86bd7c22b9b35283605 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/49461942/uploads/origins/bbd2e3c8-0e0c-4c07-a3f9-a4c10a7c5120?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=bd46b6c90b37c1bf4c5e148c49e4dbd9", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/49461942/uploads/origins/bbd2e3c8-0e0c-4c07-a3f9-a4c10a7c5120?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=bd46b6c90b37c1bf4c5e148c49e4dbd9, https://si.imgix.net/49461942/uploads/origins/bbd2e3c8-0e0c-4c07-a3f9-a4c10a7c5120?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=10a0bd745402a58c30a8072f810658fc 2x, https://si.imgix.net/49461942/uploads/origins/bbd2e3c8-0e0c-4c07-a3f9-a4c10a7c5120?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=72e0890bbb98f46e85e537df6a3e6f88 3x"}, "body": "Dear Tamamo, nice to meet you. My name is mogu hapi. I saw your illustration on Twitter and thought it was wonderful, so I made a request. I would like you to draw my favorite VTuber, Manohime Kokaku ( https://twitter.com/KoakuManohime ).\n\nRequests:.\nI would like her to look like a fluffy, innocent girl.\nI would like to leave the specific outfit, hairstyle, pose, composition, etc. to the artist.\n\nDelivery format: We may use only the character as material.\nWe would appreciate it if you could separate the character and background into separate layers, as there is a possibility that only the character will be used as a material.\n\nIntended use: I would like to use the characters and the backgrounds as materials.\nTo the extent that we would like to use the illustration, we are considering posting the illustration on Twitter with the FA tag. There is a possibility that the illustration will be mentioned on Twitter by the VTuber himself, and possibly used as a thumbnail or schedule for distribution. Of course, we will tweet the name of the artist who drew the illustration along with it, but we would like to request this from those who will allow us to do the above.\n\nThe model of the appearance is pasted on the material URL (key visual), so please refer to it...!\n\nhttps://twitter.com/KoakuManohime/status/1567498641425973255", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 95, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "ph.", "screen_name": "cusui", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/459106521318576128/jW2GBTG1.png", "header_url": null, "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 161},